[
  {"comment": "A pattern of a mirror of a boss extruded to the next face (mitcad#2432): the block is 20 mm high for x 0 to 60 and 10 mm high for x 60 to 120. The boss (Sketch3 F5, Extrude3 F6), a 10 mm circle at (15, 20) started 50 mm above the XY plane and extruded down to the block's next face, stands from z = 20 to 50; mirrored across x = 30 with Adjust, its image at (45, 20) does too. A rectangular pattern of the mirror, two along x with spacing 60, puts the boss at (75, 20) and the image at (105, 20), over the lower part: with Adjust both are built again there and end on the lower top (z = 10). Where the mirror reflects the finished boss (Identical), the pattern moves that reflected tool: the image's copy ends 10 mm above the block and reaches nothing."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 120, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},
  {"comment": "120 * 40 * 10 + 60 * 40 * 10 = 72000 mm3."},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 72000}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [15, 20], "diameter": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 50}, "flip": true,
    "extent": {"type": "to_object", "object": {"type": "body", "body": "F2.b0"}},
    "operation": "join", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},
  {"comment": "72000 + pi * 5^2 * 30 = 74356.19 mm3: the boss from z = 20 to 50."},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 74356.19449019234}},
  {"comment": "The mirror (Adjust, the default of a new mirror): the image from z = 20 to 50 as well, 76712.39 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "mirror", "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F6"]},
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [30, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0]}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Mirror1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 76712.38898038469}},

  {"comment": "The pattern with Adjust: the boss's copy and the image's copy are built again at x + 60 and run from z = 10 to 50, 76712.39 + 2 * pi * 5^2 * 40 = 82995.57 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern", "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F7"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 60},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "adjust"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1",
    "volume": 82995.57428756428, "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [120, 40, 50]}}},

  {"comment": "The mirror with Identical reflects the finished boss, and the pattern moves that reflected tool: the image's copy stands from z = 20 to 50 above the lower top and reaches no body."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "mirror", "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F6"]},
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [30, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0]}, "compute": "identical"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Mirror1", "status": "ok", "volume": 76712.38898038469}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern1", "status": "error", "error_contains": "reaches a body"}},

  {"comment": "Back to Adjust, with the boss started 10 mm higher: the boss, the image and both copies end on their own faces again, 72000 + pi * 5^2 * (2 * 40 + 2 * 50) = 86137.17 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "mirror", "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F6"]},
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [30, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0]}, "compute": "adjust"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F6", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
